## 2.3 Fix infinite loading

Implement reliable scan-state management.

Supported states should include pending, validating, discovering URLs, crawling, analyzing, collecting performance information, completed, failed, and cancelled where applicable.

The backend must decide which state is active.

Remove misleading local-only progress percentages.

Display progress using actual counters and real crawl events. When exact percentage completion cannot be measured accurately, show an honest indeterminate progress state instead of inventing progress.

